# ========== GOOGLE MAPS API KEY ==========
# This is a React (Create React App) project, so we use: REACT_APP_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY
# 
# Different frameworks use different prefixes:
# - For general backend/Node.js apps: GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY
# - For React (Create React App): REACT_APP_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY
# - For Next.js: NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY
#
# Get your API key from: https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 1. Create a new project
# 2. Enable "Maps JavaScript API"
# 3. Go to Credentials and create an API Key
# 4. Paste it below, then save and restart the server

